  "body": "Updating Firefox to https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2777 caused a web compat issue: if a cross-origin window makes its way into jQuery.extend, that function will go into an infinite loop.  This is turning up as a problem on actual sites.  See https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1412741 for details.\r\n\r\nI will be backing out the corresponding changes from Firefox. ",
